!include ../_style.iuml
hide circle
hide empty members
left to right direction
title Client ⇄ API contract mismatches (current state)

package "nos-client (src/interfaces)" {
  class IWebsite {
    {field} id : string
    {field} name : string
    {field} description : string
    {field} url : string
    {field} color : string | undefined
    {field} keywords : IKeyword[]
    {field} createdAt : string
    {field} updatedAt : string
    {field} faviconUrl : string
    {field} repo? : string
    {field} author? : IAuthor
  }
  class IKeyword {
    {field} id : string
    {field} name : string
  }
  class IRegisterWebsite {
    {field} …IPreregisterWebsite
    {field} keywords : string[] (names)
  }
  class "Client-only data" as clientOnly <<mocked>> {
    {field} likes, visits (mockWebsiteMetrics)
    {field} votes (WebsiteVotes state)
    {field} categories: label, icon, description, bookSubject
    {field}   (Feed/constants/categories.ts)
  }
}

package "nos-sr (app/schemas)" {
  class WebsiteSchema {
    {field} id : int
    {field} name : str
    {field} description : str
    {field} url : str (short code)
    {field} color : str = ""
    {field} keywords : KeywordSchema[]
    {field} createdAt : str
    {field} updatedAt : str
    {field} faviconUrl : str = ""
    {field} repo : str | None
  }
  class KeywordSchema {
    {field} id : int
    {field} name : str
    {field} createdAt : str
  }
  class PreWebsiteUpdateBodySchema {
    {field} …PreWebsiteResponseSchema
    {field} keywords : list[str]
  }
  class URLAnalyticsSchema <<issue>> {
    {field} click_count, last_accessed
    {field} (not consumed by the client)
  }
}

IWebsite .. WebsiteSchema : <color:#C62828>id string ≠ int
IWebsite .. WebsiteSchema : <color:#C62828>url: link ≠ short code
IWebsite .. WebsiteSchema : <color:#C62828>author: no backend field
IKeyword .. KeywordSchema : <color:#C62828>id string ≠ int
IRegisterWebsite .. PreWebsiteUpdateBodySchema : <color:#C62828>keywords match by name,\n<color:#C62828>but PATCH is a stub

note bottom of clientOnly
  No backend support for: categories (curated taxonomy),
  likes/votes, visit metrics, authors, webring prev/next/random.
  URL analytics exist on the backend but are unused.
end note

note as endpoints
  <b>Endpoint mismatches</b>
  • GET /website/:id returns an object; the client types it IWebsite[]
  • GET /authors/:id and GET /keywords/:id are called by client hooks
    (unused) but do not exist
  • The client calls GET /keywords, but the route is /keywords/ (blueprint prefix + '/');
    it works only because Werkzeug 308-redirects to the trailing slash
  • Errors: the client reads data.error → message; 403 and validators
    return {message}, so the client shows the axios message instead
  • MSW mocks use string ids, which hides every id-type mismatch
end note

@enduml
